+ !*
+ !* ƒ}ƒgƒŠƒbƒNƒX‰‰ZE’¸“_‚ÌÀ•W•ÏŠ·
+ !*
+ !*	| Xn |	 | M00, M01, M02, M03 | | Xa |   | M00Xa+M01Ya+M02Za+M03 |
+ !*	| Yn | = | M10, M11, M12, M13 |.| Ya | = | M10Xa+M11Ya+M12Za+M13 |
