+ !*----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ !*  mth_trif.c -- MTH ƒ‰ƒCƒuƒ‰ƒŠ OŠpŠÖ” ƒ‚ƒWƒ…[ƒ‹
+ !*  Copyright(c) 1994 SEGA
+ !*  Written by H.E on 1994-04-28 Ver.0.80
+ !*  Updated by H.E on 1994-04-28 Ver.0.80
+ !*
+ !*  ‚±‚Ìƒ‰ƒCƒuƒ‰ƒŠ‚Í”ŠwŒvZƒ‰ƒCƒuƒ‰ƒŠ‚ÌOŠpŠÖ” ƒ‚ƒ…[ƒ‹‚ÅA
+ !*  ˆÈ‰º‚Ìƒ‹[ƒ`ƒ“‚ğŠÜ‚ŞB
+ !*
+ !*  MTH_Sin                 -  ‚“‚‰‚ŠÖ”
+ !*  MTH_Cin                 -  ‚ƒ‚‚“ŠÖ”
+ !*  MTH_Atan                -  ‚‚”‚‚ŠÖ”
+ !*
+ !*----------------------------------------------------------------------------
+ !
+           .global     _MTH_Sin
+           .global     _MTH_Cos
+           .global     _MTH_Atan
+           .global     _fsin
